Package: riemann
Type: Package
Title: Bond and OIS Curve Calculations from the Riemann Rust Library
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Eiichi", "Horigome", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "besuke.poripori@gmail.com")
Description: R entry point of the Riemann financial library. The calculations are
    in Rust; the R functions convert dates and return tibbles. Dates, calendars and
    conventions follow QuantLib, and everything is passed explicitly.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports:
    tibble
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    readr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
SystemRequirements: Cargo (Rust's package manager), rustc, and on Windows the
    x86_64-pc-windows-gnu target
